<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Weider Nutrition started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Weider Nutrition started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it initiated coverage of Weider Nutrition International Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- First Boston served as the lead underwriter of Weider Nut's initial public offering on May 1.</p>
<p>-- Weider gained 3/8 to 13.</p>
</text>
